  "year": "209",
  "summary": [
    "The southern commanderies fall one after another. At Guiyang the surrendering governor offers Zhao Yun his widowed sister-in-law along with the seals, and Zhao Yun refuses — on the grounds that the man is a new subordinate, that she is a widow, and that accepting would look exactly like what it would be."
